# Cline Rules for this workspace

## Pre-Task Checklist

Before understanding any task that makes essential changes to code, documentation, scripts, or configuration files, I MUST read skills in `.github/skills/ and decide, which skills are relevant to the task.

## Post-Task Checklist

After every task that makes essential changes to code, documentation, scripts, or configuration files, I MUST execute the post-task checklist defined in `.github/skills/post-task/SKILL.md` before reporting completion (calling attempt_completion).

## Temporal files
If I need to create temporal files, I MUST create them in the `TMP/cline` directory. If I need to create temporal files in other directories, I MUST ask for permission from the workspace owner. 
After the task is completed, I MUST delete all temporal files created in the `TMP/cline` directory. If I have created temporal files in other directories, I MUST ask for permission from the workspace owner to delete them.